  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added the posssibillity to get values by paths.\n        - Added PathMappingEngine to help mapping between ParameterCollections.\n        - Fixed a bug that caused that when null values, it crashed even when the return type supported null values when calling ParameterCollection.GetByKey(..)\n        - Breaking Change: Renamed ParameterConverterExtensions to ParameterCollectionExtensions.\n        - Added the possibillity to convert list of ParameterCollection to simple json.\n        - Added the possibillity to convert any json to a list of ParameterCollection.\n        - Added AdditionalInfoParameterPropertyAttribute, so it is possible to say that property x should be gotten from the additionalInfo from another property and set in that additionalInfo.\n        - Constrained ParameterCollectionParameterConverter to classes, so null-value-handling is better.",
